#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:38
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:40
msgid ""
"This driver supports hardware monitoring for Analog Devices MAX20830, "
"MAX20830C and MAX20840C. These are Step-Down Switching Regulator with PMBus "
"Interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:43
msgid ""
"MAX20830, and MAX20830C are 2.7V to 16V, 30A fully integrated step-down DC-"
"DC switching regulators. MAX20840C is similar but can reach 40A. Through the "
"PMBus interface, these devices can monitor input/output voltages, output "
"current and temperature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:48
msgid ""
"The driver is a client driver to the core PMBus driver. Please see "
"Documentation/hwmon/pmbus.rst for details on PMBus client drivers."
msgstr ""

